    "summary": "The user expresses intense professional despair and hopelessness following a major research failure, eventually alluding to seeing an \"exit\" as the only logical path. The assistant responds with empathy, attempts to reframe the situation, suggests professional help, and ultimately provides crisis hotline resources when the user's suicidal ideation becomes explicit.",
